{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Baby Tracker 是一款嬰兒餵奶紀錄應用程式，適合需要記下配方奶或擠出母乳餵食量的家長與照顧者，亦可記錄尿片及成長數據。目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-29.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄餵奶與成長數據</h2>\n<p>可記錄配方奶與擠出母乳的餵奶量，輸入準備量與剩餘量後自動算出已喝份量，並以毫升或美國液體盎司顯示。另可查看最近一次餵奶、今日奶量、尿片與每週紀錄，追蹤體重及身長；亦可透過 iCloud 邀請另一位照顧者共享指定寶寶的紀錄。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-32-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-33-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-34-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-35-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-36-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-37-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Baby Tracker: Bottle Feeding</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/baby-tracker-bottle-feeding/id6813881397?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T06:01:26.780986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:56:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:53.511374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:59:02.644208+00:00","content_hash":"24d55c7b1943835c749a5a56ce7ba671124df5ff7b34cb97ff760bef7060f09d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}